/**
 * Whole lines only (a line is credited at most once: 409 line_already_returned). Window: today (IST) ≤ invoice doc_date + SalesPolicy.return_window_days
(policy in force on the invoice date), else 422 return_window_expired; the window is enforced only here, server-side. Cancelled bill → 409 invoice_cancelled.
Credit = the lines' taxable value + their tax as invoiced (credit_note_rounding per SalesPolicy). Settlement (refund_mode): store_credit (default per
SalesPolicy.return_settlement_default) or cash / bank_transfer, capped at what was paid on the bill; any remainder reduces balance_due.
Stock.returnToStock in the same transaction; INV-5 alert by the DB trigger. Idempotency-Key required. Requires sales.return.issue.

 * @summary S16 sales return of whole lines within the shop window: sales-return credit note (gapless CN series), stock back through Inventory
 */
